Attribution
-----------

Fluentry began as a Linux reimplementation of FluidVoice
(https://github.com/altic-dev/FluidVoice), a dictation application
licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. No source from that
project is included here — Fluentry is written in Python against Linux
interfaces — but its behaviour, settings schema and backup format
informed this work, and this notice records that origin as the licence
requires.

The audio fixture at tests/resources/dictation_fixture.wav originates
from that project's test suite and is used here under the same licence.
